y":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-12T18:54:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:25Z","closed_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:10Z"},"body":"Based on the assumption in #103999, we are able to bring `ConstIterator` to `Dictionary` without breaking the `read_only` property. Since the inner `HashMap` already has a nice iterator implementation, I just export it with alias to keep the change minimal.\r\n\r\nMain usecase of this is to replace `Dictionary::get_key_list()`. Previously if we want to iterate a `Dictionary` we have to write:\r\n```C++\r\nList<Variant> keys;\r\ndict.get_key_list(&keys);\r\nfor (const Variant &key : keys) {\r\n    const Variant &value = dict[key];\r\n    ......\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis pattern includes unnecessary heap allocation (the `List`), redundant iteration (populate keys in `get_key_list()`) and an extra hashmap lookup (if you need both key and value).\r\n\r\nWith `ConstIterator` we can now write:\r\n```C++\r\nfor (const KeyValue<Variant, Variant> &kv : dict) {\r\n    const Variant &key = kv.key;\r\n    const Variant &value = kv.value;\r\n    ......\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNo heap allocation, scan exactly one time and no hashmap lookup.\r\n\r\nI measure performance diff between the two pattern with [MRP from #100333](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100333#issuecomment-2583278772) (Note this workload is constructed intentionally to be bottlenecked at `Dictionary` iteration, `Dictionary` stringify would be a better showcase but unfortunately it is now bottlenecked by `String` concat)\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n```bash\r\n729 ms\r\n732 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n727 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n725 ms\r\n725 ms\r\n720 ms\r\n714 ms\r\naverage: 725 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n```bash\r\n271 ms\r\n270 ms\r\n273 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n272 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n273 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n272 ms\r\naverage: 271 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nCallers who sort the key list or modify values in the loop are kept untouched.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104047/reactions","total_count":18,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":13,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104047/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}